1. Install Tcl/Tk on your machine (package 'tcl').
2. Install the Tcl virtual file system (package 'tcl-vfs').
3. Copy one of the tclkits (e.g., tclkit-linux-x86_64) to the
   current directory (sdx.kit should be here already). Rename
   the tclkit to 'tclkit'.
4. If you want to work with the starkit 'sdx.kit', start with
   './tclkit sdx.kit' and use the kit's help function.
5. If you want to build the CGOS viewer, change to the viewer's
   top directory and run 'PATH="../third_party:$PATH" make'.
